{"id":"n66422-1-8","stage":4,"title":"씁쓸하다 · 发苦","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66422-1-8-1","ko":"맥주가 왜 이렇게 씁쓸해? 못 먹겠어.","zh":"啤酒怎么这么苦啊？我喝不下了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"맥주가","meaning":"啤酒","explanation":"맥주：啤酒；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"맥주","audio":"/audio/87234064f9ef0d6fd8db.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30216","senseId":"1","lemma":"맥주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"씁쓸해?","meaning":"发苦，苦涩","explanation":"씁쓸하다：发苦，苦涩；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"씁쓸하다","audio":"/audio/b2a73c89417dd90f043f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66422","senseId":"1","lemma":"씁쓸하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹겠어.","meaning":"喝","explanation":"먹다：喝；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"2","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"87234064f9ef0d6f","term":"맥주","zh":"啤酒","audio":"/audio/87234064f9ef0d6fd8db.mp3","entryId":"30216","definition":"主要以发酵的大麦添加水和苦味以及碳酸而制作的发泡酒。","pronunciation":["맥쭈"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"6